{
  "title": { "zh": "缩小时丢掉了什么", "en": "What shrinking drops" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "<level-ref to=\"1D2\"></level-ref>里放大成块，但每个旧像素都还在。这一关换一个方向：最近邻缩小图像时，没被选中的旧像素去了哪里？第一个任务把条纹图缩到一半宽、再放大回原宽，同时交出每个新像素的采样位置；第二个任务判断原图的哪些列留在了结果里。",
        "en": "In <level-ref to=\"1D2\"></level-ref> enlarging came out blocky, but every old pixel was still there. This level goes the other way: when nearest neighbour shrinks an image, what becomes of the old pixels it does not pick? The first task shrinks striped images to half their width and back again, giving each new pixel's sample position too; the second judges which of the original's columns survive."
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "1D3",
      "kind": "circuit",
      "step": { "zh": "缩小再放大", "en": "Shrink and back" },
      "brief": {
        "zh": "把输入的图缩到一半宽（高不变），交出缩小的图、每个新像素在原图里的 x，以及缩小的图再放大回原宽的样子。",
        "en": "Shrink the input to half its width (height unchanged), and give the shrunk image, each new pixel's x in the original, and the shrunk image enlarged back to the original width."
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "缩小后再放大，宽回来了：原图里的值也都回来了吗？",
          "en": "Shrinking and then enlarging brings the width back: does it bring back every value of the original too?"
        }
      ],
      "inputs": [{ "name": "image", "label": { "zh": "图", "en": "Image" } }],
      "outputs": [
        { "name": "out", "label": { "zh": "缩小后", "en": "Shrunk" } },
        { "name": "pos", "label": { "zh": "原图 x", "en": "Source x" } },
        { "name": "back", "label": { "zh": "放大回原宽", "en": "Enlarged back" } }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "inputs": { "image": [[0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 1]] },
          "expect": { "out": [[1, 1, 1, 1]], "pos": [[0.5, 2.5, 4.5, 6.5]], "back": [[1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1]] }
        },
        {
          "inputs": { "image": [[0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1, 1]] },
          "expect": { "out": [[0, 1, 0, 1]], "pos": [[0.5, 2.5, 4.5, 6.5]], "back": [[0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1, 1]] }
        }
      ],
      "hidden": [
        {
          "inputs": { "image": [[1, 2, 3, 4], [5, 6, 7, 8]] },
          "expect": {
            "out": [[2, 4], [6, 8]],
            "pos": [[0.5, 2.5], [0.5, 2.5]],
            "back": [[2, 2, 4, 4], [6, 6, 8, 8]]
          }
        },
        {
          "inputs": { "image": [[0.3, 0.9]] },
          "expect": { "out": [[0.9]], "pos": [[0.5]], "back": [[0.9, 0.9]] }
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "s = size(image)",
        "two = const[value=2]()",
        "hw = div(s.w, two)",
        "r = resizeNearest(image, hw, s.h)",
        "b = resizeNearest(r, s.w, s.h)",
        "sg = sampleGrid(s.w, s.h, hw, s.h)",
        "out <- r",
        "pos <- sg.x",
        "back <- b"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "s = size(image)",
        "two = const[value=2]()",
        "hw = div(s.w, two)",
        "r = resizeNearest(image, hw, s.h)",
        "sg = sampleGrid(s.w, s.h, hw, s.h)",
        "out <- r",
        "pos <- sg.x",
        "back <- image"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1D3_2",
      "kind": "choice",
      "step": { "zh": "哪些列留下", "en": "What survives" },
      "brief": {
        "zh": "选出值留在了缩小结果里的那些原图列。",
        "en": "Choose the original columns whose values survive in the shrunk result."
      },
      "hint": [{ "zh": "每个新像素只读原图的一列。", "en": "Each new pixel reads one column of the original." }],
      "judge": "answer",
      "rounds": [
        {
          "image": [[0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 1]],
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": {
                "zh": "这一行 8 像素宽，最近邻缩到 4 像素：哪几列的值留了下来？",
                "en": "This row, 8 pixels wide, is shrunk to 4 by nearest neighbour: which columns' values survive?"
              },
              "answer": ["c1", "c3", "c5", "c7"]
            }
          ],
          "options": [
            { "id": "c0", "label": "x = 0" },
            { "id": "c1", "label": "x = 1" },
            { "id": "c2", "label": "x = 2" },
            { "id": "c3", "label": "x = 3" },
            { "id": "c4", "label": "x = 4" },
            { "id": "c5", "label": "x = 5" },
            { "id": "c6", "label": "x = 6" },
            { "id": "c7", "label": "x = 7" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": [[0, 0.5, 1, 0, 0.5, 1, 0, 0.5, 1]],
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": {
                "zh": "这一行 9 像素宽，最近邻缩到 3 像素：哪几列的值留了下来？",
                "en": "This row, 9 pixels wide, is shrunk to 3 by nearest neighbour: which columns' values survive?"
              },
              "answer": ["c1", "c4", "c7"]
            }
          ],
          "options": [
            { "id": "c0", "label": "x = 0" },
            { "id": "c1", "label": "x = 1" },
            { "id": "c2", "label": "x = 2" },
            { "id": "c3", "label": "x = 3" },
            { "id": "c4", "label": "x = 4" },
            { "id": "c5", "label": "x = 5" },
            { "id": "c6", "label": "x = 6" },
            { "id": "c7", "label": "x = 7" },
            { "id": "c8", "label": "x = 8" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
